 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
 PROGRAM-ID. IFSTMT.
 DATA DIVISION.
 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
 01 FLAG PIC 9 VALUE 1.
 88 SOMECOND1 VALUE 1.
 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    IF SOMECOND1 THEN
       DISPLAY 'thentext'
    ELSE
       DISPLAY 'elsetext'
    END-IF.
 MOVE 0 TO FLAG.
 IF SOMECOND1 DISPLAY "thentext" ELSE DISPLAY "elsetext" END-IF.
